# Track static element type assets but not custom ones.
# ElementType.id is an autoincrement integer now (migrateElementTypeIdToInteger.js)
# instead of a hand-typed slug, and each asset folder is named `<id>-<slug>`
# (elementTypesModel.ensureAssetDir/slugify — the slug suffix tracks `name`
# and is resynced/renamed on every update, so match by id PREFIX, not the
# full folder name). 9/12/10/5 ARE powerTower/windTurbine/solarPanel/
# goliathCrane respectively (SELECT id, name FROM ElementTypes to confirm on
# any given DB; a re-run from a fresh/reordered DB can assign different
# numbers, in which case this list needs updating to match).
!server/data/element-types
server/data/element-types/*
!server/data/element-types/9-*
!server/data/element-types/12-*
!server/data/element-types/10-*
!server/data/element-types/5-*
/devices/vtol/stream/build/
